{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misoradio"]}],"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Radio button is a UI element that allows to select a single option from a set of mutually exclusive choices."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Radio button that does not show icon or text, provides greater flexibility when creating other components that require a Radio button to be displayed."}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISORadio"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"topicSections":[{"title":"Initializers","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISORadio\/init(isOn:accessibilityLabel:isError:isReadOnly:)","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISORadio\/init(isOn:accessibilityLabel:tableName:bundle:isError:isReadOnly:)"],"anchor":"Initializers"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISORadio\/body"],"title":"Instance Properties","generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Properties"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISORadio\/View-Implementations","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISORadio\/View-Implementations"],"title":"Default Implementations","generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations"}],"kind":"symbol","relationshipsSections":[{"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/7SwiftUI4ViewP"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"kind":"attribute","text":"MainActor","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISORadio"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/Controls"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Particular cases","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Particular-cases"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISORadio"},{"type":"text","text":" can be related to an error situation, for example troubles for a form."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A dedicated look-and-feel is implemented for that if the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isError"},{"type":"text","text":" flag is risen."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Accessibility considerations","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Accessibility-considerations"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Note also the component must be instanciated with a string parameter used as accessibility label."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It is a good pratice (at least) to define a label for a component without text for accessibility reasons. This label will be vocalized by "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Voice Over"}]},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The vocalization tool will also use, after the label, a description of the component (if disabled, if error context), and a fake trait for radio."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"No accessibility identifier is defined in MISO side as this value remains in the users hands."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Cases forbidden by design","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Cases-forbidden-by-design"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The design system does not allow to have both an error or read only situation and a disabled component."}]}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Code samples","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Code-samples"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["    \/\/ Supposing we have an unselected state","    @Published var selection: Bool = false","","    \/\/ A simple radio, no error, not in read only mode","    MISORadio(isOn: $selection, accessibilityLabel: \"The cake is a lie\")","","    \/\/ A simple radio, but is an error context","    MISORadio(isOn: $selection, accessibilityLabel: \"The cake is a lie\", isError: true)","","    \/\/ Never disable an error-related radio button as it will crash","    \/\/ This is forbidden by design!","    MISORadio(isOn: $selection, accessibilityLabel: \"The cake is a lie\", isError: true).disabled(true) \/\/ fatal error"]},{"type":"aside","name":"Version","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"1.4.0 (Figma component design version)"}]}],"style":"note"},{"type":"aside","name":"Since","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS 0.12.0"}]}],"style":"note"}]}],"metadata":{"externalID":"s:14MISOComponents9MISORadioV","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISORadio"}],"symbolKind":"struct","roleHeading":"Structure","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISORadio"}],"platforms":[{"unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"beta":false,"introducedAt":"15.0","name":"iOS"},{"unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"beta":false,"introducedAt":"13.0","name":"macOS"},{"introducedAt":"16.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"name":"tvOS","unavailable":false},{"unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"beta":false,"introducedAt":"1.0","name":"visionOS"},{"introducedAt":"11.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"name":"watchOS","unavailable":false}],"title":"MISORadio","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"Components"}]},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents"]]},"references":{"doc://MISOComponents/7SwiftUI4ViewP":{"title":"SwiftUICore.View","type":"unresolvable","identif